// BT-4486: a protocol-typed receiver takes a multi-arm class-tag guard over
// the protocol's known conformers (GuardedDiffPoint, its subclass and
// GuardedDiffImpostor all answer `sum`). See
// guarded_dispatch_differential_test.bt, `testProtocolTypedReceivers`.

Protocol define: GuardedDiffSummable
  sum -> Integer
